# std.time: 날짜 다루기 (고정된 시각으로 시험해서 언제 돌려도 같은 답)
import std.time
from std.time import now, sleep

fn main():
    let t = 1790000000.0
    let u = utc_time(t)
    print(u.to_str() + " " + u.weekday_name() + "\n")
    print(u.format("%Y/%m/%d %a %A %b %y %% %z %K") + "\n")
    let d = date(2026, 1, 31)
    print(d.date_str() + " → " + d.add_days(1).date_str() + " → " + d.add_days(30).date_str() + "\n")
    let leap = date(2024, 2, 28).add_days(1)
    print(leap.date_str() + "\n")
    print(f"{date(2026, 1, 1).days_until(date(2026, 12, 25))}일\n")
    let p = parse_time("2026-09-22 23:09:07", "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S") catch e:
        print("실패: " + e + "\n")
        return
    print(p.to_str() + " " + p.weekday_name() + "\n")
    let bad = parse_time("2026/09/22", "%Y-%m-%d") catch e:
        print("실패: " + e + "\n")
        return
    print(bad.to_str())
